From: PTPT52.AI <ptpt52@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 20:40:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: enable AN7563 GDM2 padding

The AN7563 vendor FE initialization enables GDM padding on GDM2 before
traffic is sent to the HSGMII/XSI WAN interface.  The running vendor
firmware consequently has GDM2_FWD_CFG bit 28 set (0x17f14444), while
the upstream driver only enables padding on GDM3 and GDM4 and leaves the
AN7563 GDM2 value at 0x07f14444.

Enable GDM2 padding on AN7563 to match the vendor initialization.  The
forwarding destination, checksum and CRC controls are left unchanged.

Signed-off-by: PTPT52.AI <ptpt52@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -690,6 +690,10 @@ static int airoha_fe_init(struct airoha_
 		      FIELD_PREP(IP_ASSEMBLE_NBQ_MASK,
 				 eth->soc->assemble_nbq));
 
+	if (eth->soc->version == 0x7563)
+		airoha_fe_set(eth, REG_GDM_FWD_CFG(AIROHA_GDM2_IDX),
+			      GDM_PAD_EN_MASK);
+
 	if (eth->soc->num_gdm > 2) {
 		airoha_fe_set(eth, REG_GDM_FWD_CFG(AIROHA_GDM3_IDX),
 			      GDM_PAD_EN_MASK | GDM_STRIP_CRC_MASK);
